cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "AdaptiGuard: A Harmonized Evaluation Framework for Runtime LLM-Agent Intervention Policies"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: AdaptiGuard Contributors
    given-names: ""
abstract: >-
  AdaptiGuard is a modular runtime defense testbed and evaluation protocol for
  prompt-injection and related LLM-agent attacks, comparing fixed and adaptive
  intervention policies under shared security, utility, and cost metrics.
keywords:
  - LLM security
  - prompt injection
  - adaptive defense
  - agent security
  - evaluation framework
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/EXAMPLE/adapti_guard"
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-09-04"
